","/farmland-atlas/iowa/woodbury-county"],["ARC or PLC in Woodbury County","/arc-plc/iowa/woodbury-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Woodbury County record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, June to July hit 183% of normal while September to October fell to 60%. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 59% and June to July at 62%. Every grid listed had its driest year in 1976, with grid 26536 down at 49%.</p>"}
